WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.100
Aim and throw your knife to defeat scarecrows.

00:04.100 --> 00:22.000
Tap dropped EXP and gold to collect them.

00:22.000 --> 00:34.700
Try one area at a time and use Retreat.

00:34.700 --> 00:45.700
Tap Michitaka at the top right to check growth.

00:45.700 --> 00:56.200
To quit: bottom MENU, popup Menu, then confirm.

00:56.200 --> 00:57.800
Collected EXP and gold are added at the menu, even after game over.
